DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Wenn ich im SchNeppchenmarkt bin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
kaufe ich immer tonnenweise Kram
ein, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Koşuya çıktıktan sonra eve dönmeden önce
genelde buraya uğrayıp bir şeyler alırım!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Quando non so se comprare
una cosa o no, mi affido sempre
alla scienza!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ambarabà,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ciccì,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} coccò,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tre{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} civette{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sul{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} comò...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Provaci anche tu. È un metodo
infallibile, oltre che scientifico!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
